# game/UpdateScript0.04.rpy:1504 #-#-# translate crowdin hire_a_maid_ace6aa2e:
msgid "[_M_] I can't be here in the morning when she'll have to come over and start the chores.... so I give you permission to make them as hard and humiliating as possible..."
